### :param new: The value to write when it matches.
### :returns: `Unit` when `new` was written, the value found (a `T`) when not.
routine Atomic[T].compare_exchange_weak_acquire(me: @Me, expected: T, new: T) -> Result[None, T]
needs T: typename, AtomicExchangeable[T]
    return me.value.atomic_compare_exchange_weak_acquire(expected, new)

### Writes `new` if the value is `expected`, atomically and release: `Unit` if it did, the value found if
