### :returns: `Unit` when `new` was written, the value found (a `T`) when not.
routine Atomic[T].compare_exchange_weak_acq_rel(me: @Me, expected: T, new: T) -> Result[None, T]
needs T: typename, AtomicExchangeable[T]
    return me.value.atomic_compare_exchange_weak_acq_rel(expected, new)

